            "review_title": "Review at Que Xua Restaurant",
            "review_text": "216spring\nUdon Thani, Thailand802 contributions\n0\nGo for the real.\nJul 2019 • Family\nLittle Vietnamese resto serving local specialties, DIY spring rolls served with plate of sliced pork, add a bowl of noodle and a HUDA then you get a typical Vietnamese dinner. The place is loud, noisy, busy, crowded and NOT ac. Food is great, friendly service. Located a 5 min walk.on the street behind the Minh Toan Galxy hotel. Should you walk that street back towards the Dragon bridge, you would discover great little restos and the best Banh Mi shop in Da Nang... Worth the effort. Enjoy.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten July 10, 2019",
