            "review_text": "haphuongthao14\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam226 contributions\n1\nDelicious spring rolls\nApr 2018 • Family\nYou should taste the spring rolls at there. A combo of spring rolls include 1 dish of pork meat, 1 dish of green vegetables, rice cake and noodle cake. The slice of pork meat is thin. There are 2 types of fish sauces to use, if you never eat this food, i recommend you should choose the yellow garlic fish sauce. My quang is delicious also. The price is cheap to have a big meal.\nRead more\nWritten April 3, 2018",
